    Measured 2026-08-28: N=1e16 at 54.18 V vs analysis 51.79 V (ratio
    1.046 -- within 10%, see the strict gate below); N=2e16 at 35.70 V
    vs analysis 33.72 V (ratio 1.059 -- ALSO within 10%).  The assertion
