# measured, sub-floor densities in converged II solves sit in a round-off
# limit cycle of 2-5e-18 (M15 at -32V: p = 3.1e-11; M34-S2 at -20V: p
# 1.1e-17 <-> 1.6e-17 on the n+ side, period 2) with the residual at
